{"completed": true, "response": "{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"text\": \"那份柔和的喜悦还在，他愿意多停留一会儿，怀念和欣慰一起来了，也没有急着取舍。\",\n      \"src\": [\"I83\", \"I84\", \"I85\"],\n      \"cite\": [\"I81\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"他感激曾经拥有过那样的生活，也为如今还能珍惜它而高兴，想起过去不觉得自己可怜。\",\n      \"src\": [\"I86\", \"I87\", \"I88\"],\n      \"cite\": []\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"从前留给他的宽厚和勇气仿佛又回来了，他仍肯定如今的自己，也没有疏远过去。\",\n      \"src\": [\"I89\", \"I90\", \"I94\"],\n      \"cite\": [\"I72\", \"I73\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"没有什么新的保证，他只顾珍惜手里已有的这些，暂时没去追问还失去了什么。\",\n      \"src\": [\"I91\", \"I92\", \"I93\"],\n      \"cite\": []\n    }\n  ]\n}", "metadata": {"session_handle": "805338b4-248b-49da-8925-4ea80d4ec96e", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261101T044959600036Z", "elapsed_seconds": 49.438, "completed_utc": "2026-11-01T04:50:49.036489+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "da8239fc2d2822b04aa6c6aa4f690c62396d34e232d2fbdb7023fcbff4a5ed5e", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8dde